			"notes": "Large update to coincide with a new pvp focused update on Dystoria.\n\n## Additions\n- Battle HUD\n  - The existing pokeball displays have been upgraded into an entire battle HUD.\n  - The HUD works entirely clientside, making Dystoria Tweaks a clean alternative to other battle HUD mods.\n  - Using the HUD on Dystoria itself will let it connect to other items such as the Team Sheets and provide additional information.\n- Config menu\n  - All features of Tweaks are now togglable in a Mod Menu config menu."
		},
